Dedicated Hosts - dedicated physical
host.
ex) Bring your own license

Dedicated Instances - Instances will not run on hardware that is shared with other AWS accounts.

Spot Instances - uses spare EC2
capacity. Available for much less
than on demand price. (up to 90% off) 
Can be shutdown at any time. AWS
will attempt to give you a two
minute warning before the instance is reclaimed.

Spot capacity pools - Select pool that has best capacity for
the spot instance.
Instances will be distributed across all spot capacity pools.
-Great for workloads with flexible start and end times.